# dsfsm (tools/cov/specs/darksamus_dsfsm.py): rooftop boss u04f7 (Sanctuary 10_cliff_rooftop layer 2).
# DiveAfterBoost keys, EnrageHitReact, Null, then Dead during the boost ball (the roll emitter set).
@f600 send u04f7 Activate; god 1
@f625 trigcall u04f7 DiveAfterBoost 111; trigcall u04f7 DiveAfterBoost 110; trigcall u04f7 DiveAfterBoost 119; trigcall u04f7 DiveAfterBoost 112; trigcall u04f7 DiveAfterBoost 119
@f650 trigcall u04f7 DiveAfterBoost 113; trigcall u04f7 DiveAfterBoost 114; trigcall u04f7 DiveAfterBoost 119; trigcall u04f7 DiveAfterBoost 111
@f675 fsm u04f7 EnrageHitReact
@f750 fsm u04f7 Null
@f800 fsm u04f7 BoostBallInto
@f830 fsm u04f7 Dead
@f950 status
